==Description== <!--T:3-->

<!--T:4-->
The [[Image:Silk_CubicCurve_4.svg|24px]] '''Silk CubicCurve 4''' command creates a parametric Bézier cubic curve, a CubicCurve_4 object, from a [[Image:Silk_ControlPoly4.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlPoly4|4 point polygon]] or a [[Image:Silk_ControlPoly4_segment.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlPoly4_segment|4 point polygon for segments]].

